<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Real-Time World Crafting: Generating Structured Game Behaviors from Natural Language with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In Real-Time World Crafting: Generating Structured Game Behaviors from Natural Language with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Abridged Prompts</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
