<tr id="A2.T3.2.31" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T3.2.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" colspan="8"><span id="A2.T3.2.31.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Note.</span> <math id="A2.T3.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{G}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>η</mi><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{G}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> = generalized eta-squared. Significance codes: * <math id="A2.T3.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.05</annotation></semantics></math>, † <math id="A2.T3.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.01</annotation></semantics></math>, ‡ <math id="A2.T3.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math></th></tr>
